# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
#
# The repo is authored with LF. `* text=auto` normalises to LF in the index and
# lets Git convert on checkout per core.autocrlf, which is what we want for
# source. The generated bundle is additionally pinned to LF: dist/coding-plans.mjs
# is a build artefact that must be byte-reproducible from `npm run build:dist`,
# and CRLF there would make local builds differ from committed output.
* text=auto
dist/*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

